# VHS tape (github.com/charmbracelet/vhs) to record the killer-demo GIF.
#   vhs examples/demo.tape   ->   examples/reagraph-demo.gif
# Shows REA's raw id-diff (59 of 56 nodes "changed") vs reagraph's 1 real change,
# on two REAL rea-agents analyses bundled in the package. No REA/Docker needed.
Output examples/reagraph-demo.gif
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1100
Set Height 640
Set Padding 24
Set Theme "Dracula"
Type "reagraph demo"
Sleep 400ms
Enter
Sleep 6s
